rner@chromium.org" pass_count="0" patch_number="3" project="chromiumos/platform/depthcharge" project_url="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/depthcharge" ref="refs/changes/35/323835/3" remote="cros" total_fail_count="1"/><pending_commit branch="master" change_id="I4ea28363a36ea712c0d0945a15ad93a211e355f5" commit="d2058fd5dc10eda4cd1364c28fce42945d9ed65a" commit_message="rialto: Make use of dummy sound driver  This will make the custom_music code not ignore the custom_music (since it tought there was no sound card defined). So we make use of a dummy soundcard now.  BRANCH=master BUG=chrome-os-partner:48657 TEST=Longer delay works without removing unnecessary if  Change-Id: I4ea28363a36ea712c0d0945a15ad93a211e355f5 Signed-off-by: Alexandru M Stan &lt;amstan@chromium.org&gt; Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/323801 Commit-Ready: Alexandru Stan &lt;amstan@chromium.org&gt; Tested-by: Alexandru Stan &lt;amstan@chromium.org&gt; Reviewed-by: Julius Werner &lt;jwerner@chromium.org&gt; " fail_count="2" gerrit_number="323801" owner_email="amstan@chromium.org" pass_count="0" patch_number="2" project="chromiumos/platform/depthcharge" project_url="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/depthcharge" ref="refs/changes/01/323801/2" remote="cros" total_fail_count="2"/><pending_commit branch="chromeos-2015.07" change_id="I3c2e268689d64683f4a138e20f518e6eda49a138" commit="e8a3624421d9d7498c51811a40f0dd6842ba9537" commit_message="ec: chromeec: Update EC command header  Update to the latest EC command header.  BUG=chrome-os-partner:46049 BRANCH=none TEST=emerge-glados coreboot  Change-Id: I3c2e268689d64683f4a138e20f518e6eda49a138 Signed-off-by: Duncan Laurie &lt;dlaurie@chromium.org&gt; Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/315216 Commit-Ready: Aaron Durbin &lt;adurbin@chromium.org&gt; Tested-by: Aaron Durbin &lt;adurbin@chromium.org&gt; Reviewed-by: Aaron Durbin &lt;adurbin@chromium.org&gt; " fail_count=